{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "clm_soiltemp",
  "description": "CTSM/CLM snow/soil temperature (stage 2 of the EqESM project): the SoilThermProp thermal-property laws of SoilTemperatureMod.F90 (ctsm5.4.063, cesm3.0-alphabranch checkout, fork commit ab94ab484), pinned against the W3 stage-1 dump stage1/dumps/clm/clm_soiltemp.csv (LID 261103-111900; 16 traced columns, ctype = 1 soil, snl = -9, 34 layers, 12 steps; the tests pin column 1 at step 1). SoilThermProp (F90:604-903) computes, per layer: the snow bulk density bw (:744), the Sturm1997 snow thermal conductivity (:774-778; the snow_thermal_cond_method of the traced run; the five coefficients lack _r8 in the Fortran and execute as float32-rounded values, bugs.md #31, reproduced here to rel 1.6e-16), the snow heat capacity with the thin-layer floor (:892-895), the Johansen (1975) soil thermal conductivity (:712-727) composed of the saturation water content (:712-713), the Kersten number (:715-719), the liquid fraction (:720-721) and the saturated conductivity (:722), with the bedrock override (:727), the de Vries (1963) soil heat capacity (:852-854) with the bedrock override (:854), and the harmonic-mean interface thermal conductivity with the zero bottom boundary (:825-828). The layer index set is the CLM top-down column: layer = 1..34 maps to j = -8..25 (snow j = -8..0, soil j = 1..25). All four outputs are pinned per layer at rel 1e-12: the dumped values are reproduced to the dump's full double precision (max rel residual 3.1e-16, verified independently in Python before pinning). Coverage gaps of the traced dump, each with its reason: imelt = 0 on every row (no phase change in the 12 traced steps), so the Phasechange laws are not exercised; snow_thermal_cond_method = 'Sturm1997' only (the Jordan1991 template exists but is untested); frac_sno_fluxes = 1 exactly; excess_ice = 0 and h2osoi_liq = 0 in the snow layers (the excess-ice and snow-liquid terms never bind); h2osno_no_layers = 0 (the cv(c,1) += cpice*h2osno_no_layers addition of :880-882 is not exercised). The top snow layer carries a ~3e-5 m inconsistency between (z, dz) and the dumped interface depths (bugs.md #32); the harmonic formula absorbs it exactly when fed the dumped zi. Reference: stage1/cesm/components/clm/src/biogeophys/SoilTemperatureMod.F90 and stage1/cesm/components/clm/src/main/clm_varcon.F90.",
  "license": "MIT"
 },
 "index_sets": {
  "layer": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "N_LAYER"
  }
 },
 "metaparameters": {
  "N_LAYER": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 34,
   "description": "number of snow + soil layers in the stage-2 skeleton (snl = -9 snow layers plus nlevgrnd = 25 soil layers), [-]"
  }
 },
 "models": {
  "SoilThermProp": {
   "expression_template_imports": [
    {
     "ref": "./clm_templates.esm"
    }
   ],
   "variables": {
    "dz": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "layer thickness dz(j) [m] (SoilThermProp input; dump column dz, entry stage)",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "default": 0.0
    },
    "z": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "layer center depth z(j) [m], negative in snow, positive in soil (dump column z, entry stage)",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "default": 0.0
    },
    "zi_below": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "depth of the interface below layer j, zi(c,j) [m] (dump column zi_bot, entry stage; the 34th entry zi(25) is unused, the bottom boundary carries no interface)",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "default": 0.0
    },
    "h2osoi_liq": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "kg/m^2",
     "description": "layer liquid water mass (dump column h2osoi_liq, entry stage; 0 in all snow layers of the dump)",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "default": 0.0
    },
    "h2osoi_ice": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "kg/m^2",
     "description": "layer ice mass (dump column h2osoi_ice, entry stage; unchanged entry to exit since imelt = 0 everywhere)",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "default": 0.0
    },
    "excess_ice": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "kg/m^2",
     "description": "excess-ice water equivalent (use_excess_ice = .true. in the run; 0 for all dumped layers), [kg/m2]",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "default": 0.0
    },
    "t_soisno": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "K",
     "description": "layer temperature at the entry stage, the value SoilThermProp consumes (dump column t_soisno, entry stage; the phase-change flag imelt = 0 on every dumped row)",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "default": 0.0
    },
    "tkmg": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "W/m/K",
     "description": "saturated thermal conductivity of the mineral matrix, tkmg = tkm^(1-watsat) (SoilStateInitTimeConstMod.F90:581; dump column tkmg, entry stage: uniform 3.019245073504738 across j = 1..25; NaN for snow layers in the dump, replaced here by 0.0 dummies that sit in the discarded branch of the layer ifelse)",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "default": 0.0
    },
    "tkdry": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "W/m/K",
     "description": "dry soil thermal conductivity (SoilStateInitTimeConstMod.F90:585; dump column tkdry, entry stage: uniform 0.2157223650051119 across j = 1..25; 0.0 dummy for snow)",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "default": 0.0
    },
    "watsat": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "soil porosity (soil dataset; dump column watsat, entry stage: uniform 0.43482 across j = 1..25; 0.0 dummy for snow)",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "default": 0.0
    },
    "csol": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "J/m^3/K",
     "description": "soil matrix volumetric heat capacity (soil dataset; dump column csol, entry stage: uniform 2.20383606557377e6 across j = 1..25; 0.0 dummy for snow)",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "default": 0.0
    },
    "frac_sno_fluxes": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "fraction of the ground covered by snow for heat-flux calculations (waterdiagnosticbulk_inst%frac_sno_fluxes_col; the dump pins 1 exactly via the snow heat-capacity law)",
     "default": 1.0
    },
    "nbedrock": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "layer index at which bedrock begins: layers j > nbedrock are bedrock (col%nbedrock; the dump pins nbedrock = 20, i.e. bedrock at j = 21..25, layer = 30..34)",
     "default": 20.0
    },
    "denh2o": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "kg/m^3",
     "description": "density of liquid water SHR_CONST_RHOFW (clm_varcon.F90:64)",
     "default": 1000.0
    },
    "denice": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "kg/m^3",
     "description": "density of ice SHR_CONST_RHOICE (clm_varcon.F90:65)",
     "default": 917.0
    },
    "cpice": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "J/kg/K",
     "description": "specific heat of ice SHR_CONST_CPICE (clm_varcon.F90:58)",
     "default": 2117.27
    },
    "cpliq": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "J/kg/K",
     "description": "specific heat of liquid water SHR_CONST_CPFW (clm_varcon.F90:57)",
     "default": 4188.0
    },
    "tfrz": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "K",
     "description": "freezing point of water SHR_CONST_TKFRZ (clm_varcon.F90:76)",
     "default": 273.15
    },
    "tkair": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "W/m/K",
     "description": "thermal conductivity of air (clm_varcon.F90:73)",
     "default": 0.023
    },
    "tkice": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "W/m/K",
     "description": "thermal conductivity of ice (clm_varcon.F90:74)",
     "default": 2.29
    },
    "tkwat": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "W/m/K",
     "description": "thermal conductivity of liquid water (clm_varcon.F90:75)",
     "default": 0.57
    },
    "thk_bedrock": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "W/m/K",
     "description": "bedrock thermal conductivity (clm_varcon.F90:121)",
     "default": 3.0
    },
    "csol_bedrock": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "J/m^3/K",
     "description": "bedrock volumetric heat capacity (clm_varcon.F90:123)",
     "default": 2000000.0
    },
    "thin_sfclayer": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "J/m^2/K",
     "description": "heat-capacity floor for thin surface layers, thin_sfclayer = 1.0e-6 (SoilTemperatureMod.F90:85): a J/m2/K floor in the snow heat-capacity law (:892-895), never binding in the dump (every snow layer has cv >> 1e-6)",
     "default": 1e-06
    },
    "bw": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/m^3",
     "description": "snow bulk density (0 outside the snow layers), [kg/m3]",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ]
    },
    "thk_layer": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m/K",
     "description": "layer thermal conductivity: Sturm1997 for snow, Johansen 1975 for soil, thk_bedrock for bedrock (SoilThermProp), [W/m/K]",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ]
    },
    "cv": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "J/m^2/K",
     "description": "layer heat capacity per unit ground area (SoilThermProp; dump column cv, exit stage), [J/m2/K]",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ]
    },
    "tk": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m/K",
     "description": "thermal conductivity at the interface below the layer, harmonic mean of the adjacent layer conductivities; 0 at the bottom boundary (SoilThermProp :825-828; dump column tk, exit stage), [W/m/K]",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ]
    }
   },
   "equations": [
    {
     "lhs": "bw",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "faq",
      "args": [
       "h2osoi_liq",
       "h2osoi_ice",
       "frac_sno_fluxes",
       "dz"
      ],
      "output_idx": [
       "layer"
      ],
      "ranges": {
       "layer": {
        "from": "layer"
       }
      },
      "expr": {
       "op": "ifelse",
       "args": [
        {
         "op": "<=",
         "args": [
          "layer",
          9
         ]
        },
        {
         "op": "apply_expression_template",
         "args": [],
         "name": "snow_bulk_density",
         "bindings": {
          "h2osoi_ice": {
           "op": "index",
           "args": [
            "h2osoi_ice",
            "layer"
           ]
          },
          "h2osoi_liq": {
           "op": "index",
           "args": [
            "h2osoi_liq",
            "layer"
           ]
          },
          "frac_sno_fluxes": "frac_sno_fluxes",
          "dz": {
           "op": "index",
           "args": [
            "dz",
            "layer"
           ]
          }
         }
        },
        0.0
       ]
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "thk_layer",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "faq",
      "args": [
       "bw",
       "h2osoi_liq",
       "h2osoi_ice",
       "excess_ice",
       "dz",
       "watsat",
       "t_soisno",
       "tkmg",
       "tkdry",
       "nbedrock",
       "thk_bedrock",
       "denh2o",
       "denice",
       "tfrz",
       "tkwat",
       "tkice"
      ],
      "output_idx": [
       "layer"
      ],
      "ranges": {
       "layer": {
        "from": "layer"
       }
      },
      "expr": {
       "op": "ifelse",
       "args": [
        {
         "op": "<=",
         "args": [
          "layer",
          9
         ]
        },
        {
         "op": "apply_expression_template",
         "args": [],
         "name": "snow_thermal_cond_sturm1997",
         "bindings": {
          "bw": {
           "op": "index",
           "args": [
            "bw",
            "layer"
           ]
          }
         }
        },
        {
         "op": "ifelse",
         "args": [
          {
           "op": ">",
           "args": [
            {
             "op": "-",
             "args": [
              "layer",
              9
             ]
            },
            "nbedrock"
           ]
          },
          "thk_bedrock",
          {
           "op": "apply_expression_template",
           "args": [],
           "name": "soil_thermal_cond",
           "bindings": {
            "h2osoi_liq": {
             "op": "index",
             "args": [
              "h2osoi_liq",
              "layer"
             ]
            },
            "h2osoi_ice": {
             "op": "index",
             "args": [
              "h2osoi_ice",
              "layer"
             ]
            },
            "excess_ice": {
             "op": "index",
             "args": [
              "excess_ice",
              "layer"
             ]
            },
            "dz": {
             "op": "index",
             "args": [
              "dz",
              "layer"
             ]
            },
            "watsat": {
             "op": "index",
             "args": [
              "watsat",
              "layer"
             ]
            },
            "t_soisno": {
             "op": "index",
             "args": [
              "t_soisno",
              "layer"
             ]
            },
            "tkmg": {
             "op": "index",
             "args": [
              "tkmg",
              "layer"
             ]
            },
            "tkdry": {
             "op": "index",
             "args": [
              "tkdry",
              "layer"
             ]
            },
            "denh2o": "denh2o",
            "denice": "denice",
            "tfrz": "tfrz",
            "tkwat": "tkwat",
            "tkice": "tkice"
           }
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "cv",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "faq",
      "args": [
       "h2osoi_liq",
       "h2osoi_ice",
       "excess_ice",
       "dz",
       "frac_sno_fluxes",
       "cpliq",
       "cpice",
       "thin_sfclayer",
       "csol",
       "watsat",
       "csol_bedrock",
       "nbedrock"
      ],
      "output_idx": [
       "layer"
      ],
      "ranges": {
       "layer": {
        "from": "layer"
       }
      },
      "expr": {
       "op": "ifelse",
       "args": [
        {
         "op": "<=",
         "args": [
          "layer",
          9
         ]
        },
        {
         "op": "apply_expression_template",
         "args": [],
         "name": "snow_heat_capacity",
         "bindings": {
          "h2osoi_liq": {
           "op": "index",
           "args": [
            "h2osoi_liq",
            "layer"
           ]
          },
          "h2osoi_ice": {
           "op": "index",
           "args": [
            "h2osoi_ice",
            "layer"
           ]
          },
          "frac_sno_fluxes": "frac_sno_fluxes",
          "cpliq": "cpliq",
          "cpice": "cpice",
          "thin_sfclayer": "thin_sfclayer"
         }
        },
        {
         "op": "ifelse",
         "args": [
          {
           "op": ">",
           "args": [
            {
             "op": "-",
             "args": [
              "layer",
              9
             ]
            },
            "nbedrock"
           ]
          },
          {
           "op": "*",
           "args": [
            "csol_bedrock",
            {
             "op": "index",
             "args": [
              "dz",
              "layer"
             ]
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "op": "apply_expression_template",
           "args": [],
           "name": "soil_heat_capacity",
           "bindings": {
            "csol": {
             "op": "index",
             "args": [
              "csol",
              "layer"
             ]
            },
            "watsat": {
             "op": "index",
             "args": [
              "watsat",
              "layer"
             ]
            },
            "dz": {
             "op": "index",
             "args": [
              "dz",
              "layer"
             ]
            },
            "h2osoi_ice": {
             "op": "index",
             "args": [
              "h2osoi_ice",
              "layer"
             ]
            },
            "h2osoi_liq": {
             "op": "index",
             "args": [
              "h2osoi_liq",
              "layer"
             ]
            },
            "excess_ice": {
             "op": "index",
             "args": [
              "excess_ice",
              "layer"
             ]
            },
            "cpice": "cpice",
            "cpliq": "cpliq"
           }
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "tk",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "faq",
      "args": [
       "thk_layer",
       "z",
       "zi_below"
      ],
      "output_idx": [
       "layer"
      ],
      "ranges": {
       "layer": {
        "from": "layer"
       }
      },
      "expr": {
       "op": "ifelse",
       "args": [
        {
         "op": "==",
         "args": [
          "layer",
          "N_LAYER"
         ]
        },
        0.0,
        {
         "op": "apply_expression_template",
         "args": [],
         "name": "clm_interface_conductivity",
         "bindings": {
          "thk1": {
           "op": "index",
           "args": [
            "thk_layer",
            "layer"
           ]
          },
          "thk2": {
           "op": "index",
           "args": [
            "thk_layer",
            {
             "op": "min",
             "args": [
              "N_LAYER",
              {
               "op": "+",
               "args": [
                "layer",
                1
               ]
              }
             ]
            }
           ]
          },
          "z1": {
           "op": "index",
           "args": [
            "z",
            "layer"
           ]
          },
          "z2": {
           "op": "index",
           "args": [
            "z",
            {
             "op": "min",
             "args": [
              "N_LAYER",
              {
               "op": "+",
               "args": [
                "layer",
                1
               ]
              }
             ]
            }
           ]
          },
          "zi": {
           "op": "index",
           "args": [
            "zi_below",
            "layer"
           ]
          }
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    }
   ],
   "tests": [
    {
     "id": "clm_soiltemp_snow_cv_step1_col1",
     "description": "Snow-layer heat capacity cv (SoilThermProp snow branch, SoilTemperatureMod.F90:892-895) pinned against clm_soiltemp.csv (column 1, step 1): layers j = -8..0 (layer = 1..9). cv = max(thin_sfclayer, (cpliq*h2osoi_liq + cpice*h2osoi_ice)/frac_sno_fluxes) with h2osoi_liq = 0 and the dumped h2osoi_ice; the reproduction to rel 1.6e-16 pins frac_sno_fluxes = 1 exactly (any other value scales every snow-layer cv). The thin_sfclayer floor never binds (all dumped snow layers have cv >> 1e-6).",
